{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36590","headline":"送魏校书兼呈曹使君 · 罗隐","name":"送魏校书兼呈曹使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱离无计驻生涯，又事东游惜岁华。\n村店酒旗沽竹叶，野桥梅雨泊芦花。\n讐书发迹官虽屈，负米安亲路不赊。\n应见使君论世旧，埽门重得向曹家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}